  "text": "This helicopter was built for five flights on Mars. It flew seventy-two. The air there is about 1% as thick as ours. Its blades spun more than 2,000 times a minute to lift it. In 2024, a damaged blade finally grounded it. It's still standing there. The full film, Could a Robot Survive on Mars?",
